WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
«I feel alone. My sponsor disappeared.»

2
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.170
«Sign up, I'll help you.»

3
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.350
And after a week they stop answering.

4
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.160
Inside RelAI there's a Consultant, at any hour.

5
00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.660
The first thing it does is ask you questions: why you're doing it,

6
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.190
what's at stake for you,

7
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.110
where you want to get to. And it doesn't forget them.

8
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.610
Every morning at 8 it writes to you.

9
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.570
On bad days it doesn't say «come on, keep going»:

10
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.010
it brings you back to the reason you started.

11
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.260
And if you tell it something that weighs on you,

12
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.150
it listens like a person.

13
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.580
The leader you'd want beside you.

14
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.290
Always.
